AllowUsers nethack
HostKey /var/lib/jnethack/ssh/ssh_host_ed25519_key
PermitRootLogin no
PasswordAuthentication no
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
PubkeyAuthentication no
UsePAM no
PrintMotd no
PrintLastLog no
PermitUserRC no
DisableForwarding yes
PermitTunnel no
ForceCommand /usr/local/libexec/jnethack-session

Match User nethack
    PasswordAuthentication yes
    PermitEmptyPasswords yes
